 "summary": {
  "en": "A dust plume (CMAQ dust speciation: Ca, K, Mg, Na as fractions of dust) mixes with polluted air rich in nitric acid and ammonia while RH rises from 30% to 85%. With ISORROPIA II the crustal cations neutralise nitrate on dust (Ca(NO3)2); with v1 dust is inert.",
  "zh": "沙尘气团（CMAQ 沙尘组分：Ca、K、Mg、Na 占沙尘质量比例）与富含硝酸和氨的污染气团混合，RH 从 30% 升至 85%。ISORROPIA II 中地壳阳离子在沙尘上中和硝酸盐（Ca(NO3)2）；v1 中沙尘为惰性。"
 },
